reconstructed the helper protocol (contracts/helper-protocol-delta.md "Frames", research D-2, D-7) as ClientHelper writes it for op=clusterNodes, request without details.
An unknown progress frame between node ok and the member frames, as fixtures/server-log/v8_1/webservice/garbage_frames.frames; the rest is ok.frames. Not recorded: written by hand with the fixed nonce of the 020/021 fixtures and the two log4j lines of fixtures/server-log/v8_1/webservice/ok.frames; all names and values are fictitious (node1, node2, zone-a, 10.0.0.11:7800, /opt/inubit/...), the form of the version, the node id and the uptime is invented.
